      "pubkey": "dW50cnVzdGVkIGNvbW1lbnQ6IG1pbmlzaWduIHB1YmxpYyBrZXk6IDg1QjcxMzc3NTc2RDBFNkMKUldSc0RtMVhkeE8zaFhSNXpRT1Z2TVpiRnh2eXJ2VUF1aW54RDhvem9wMVVjNWViVGNTVldEbkUK",
      "endpoints": [
        "https://github.com/aminebarcelon28-bit/mobi-pos/releases/latest/download/latest.json"
      ]
    }
  }
}
